<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Alongside this, an IBA-approved Lorry Receipt (LR) or Bilty serves as the primary contract of carriage.</p>
